{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/subtext-eng01.png?t=1746195723\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/RumbleSample.gif?t=1746195723\" /><br>- Battle Royale Brawl featuring 33 players<br>- 12+ Characters with Unique Actions and Ultimates<br>- Features a Solos Mode, which focuses on individual mechanics, and Trios Mode, which adds teamplay to the mix<br>- High-quality cartoon rendered characters with a variety of costumes, animated Emotes, and cute Emojis<br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/subtext-eng02.png?t=1746195723\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/ComboSample.gif?t=1746195723\" /><br>The key to ASURAJANG's combat is mastering combos and counters, like in a fighting game.<br>Perform a Combo Attack when the enemy lets their guard down to claim victory in battle.<br>But beware - if the opponent dodges your attack, they will get a chance to counter.<br>Master the art of mixing attacks, dodges, and counters to blow away your enemies.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/subtext-eng03.png?t=1746195723\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/3vs1Sample.gif?t=1746195723\" /><br>Each Asura possesses a unique Ultimate Action.<br>Use these Ultimates to eliminate enemy players, protect teammates, or simply survive.<br>A single Ultimate can change the outcome of the game.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2549130?t=1746195723","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/page_bg_raw.jpg?t